\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lower Drainage Area 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"113\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lower_Drainage_Area_2_dc8794.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Lower Drainage Area</b> is not very suitable for hunting, since the Fungi creatures hit considerably hard and go invisible often, and their loot isn't very good. \n</p><p>The <a href=\"#/quest/oramond-quest\">Oramond Quest</a> and the <a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a> have missions that take place here.\n</p><p>To reach this dungeon, enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sewer%20Grate\">Sewer Grate</a> at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33622,31978,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33622, 31978, 7)</a>, then get to the ramp <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33660,31892,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33660, 31892, 9)</a> (you can use the teleport one floor down of the ladder, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33614,31985,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33614, 31985, 10)</a>, as a shortcut). \n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-al